{"reviewId": "24104992_7Xolgoykp", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "太阳黑子理论有两种含义：一是经济学理论，由英国经济学家杰文斯提出，认为太阳黑子的出现会引起农业减产，进而影响工业、商业等，导致经济萧条，其实质是将经济危机归结为自然原因；二是天文学概念，指太阳光球表面出现的暗区域，是磁场聚集的地方，其活动与地球天气和气候有密切关系。转自百度AI\n我的理解是，经济周期的波动和太阳黑子的周期性可能存在着某种相关性，但并非关键的直接因素。经济的周期性会受到诸多因素的影响，除了客观的自然环境，还有人与社会。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "7359-7404", "abstract": "这一认识的分支是太阳黑子学说，因为太阳黑子的变化导致了气候变化，从而导致初级产品价格波动。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "24104992_7Xolgoykp", "userVid": 24104992, "topics": [], "createTime": 1737538688, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 24104992, "name": "木叶晶", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0026-VnaQ7T1TGHdKJyZM2JRdW10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "努力在矛盾中寻找平衡", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "沧海一粟", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 28, "likes": [{"userVid": 49037076, "name": "Jessie", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKXLAsUygdrmGurnd7yBBRDloc9Hn1NaFqdt6wyd3CqGxDHhliaXMgtfgk2Y8wDsmVQ3HKLJ1zbBmJeYhcYt7r0xLx7wlZ1oQOrQoxLT9KBEsQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230710-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "最近几年太阳黑子活动是不是频繁？经济是不是不好？", "re